## Troubleshooting log

| Problem | Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `ERROR 1045 (28000): Access denied for user 'admin'` | Wrong password for the RDS master user | Re-entered the correct credentials / reset the master password |
| `ERROR 1049: Unknown database 'waitlist'` and `ERROR 1046: No database selected` | Database not created or selected yet | Created the database, then ran `USE waitlist;` |
| `ERROR 1064` syntax error | Typo in the command (`show datebase`) | Corrected to `SHOW DATABASES;` |
| PHP `getaddrinfo for your-db-host failed` in the Apache error log | The placeholder DB host was still in `index.php` | Replaced it with the RDS endpoint |

